    "title": "Write a practical message",
    "subtitle": "What the speaker means · 1 · preparation 2",
    "context": "Use this subset of the discourse vocabulary and constructions in a short self-contained situation, preparing for U4-39. Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to interpret a qualification, reason or contrast and distinguish it from a literal misreading.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U4-39-P02-compose-produce",
